Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a MODIFIED fork of `modular/modular`, branched at upstream commit
f66d4d52, published at https://github.com/albanread/MojoRISCOS. It is not Modular's distribution and Modular does not support,
endorse or maintain it. Files in the following areas have been added or
changed relative to that base:

    KGEN/          compiler driver and target plumbing: a RISC OS target,
                   AArch32 code generation reached through the ARM backend
    bazel/         build configuration — ARM backend enabled in the vendored
                   LLVM, toolchains and sysroot rules per port
    mojo/          standard library: `sys` and platform layers reached
                   through RISC OS SWIs rather than POSIX
    Support/       host-side portability (paths, logging, threading)
    AsyncRT/       runtime glue for the ported hosts
    max/, nvptx/   device-layer implementations written against the
                   published ABI declarations
    examples/, spikes/, riscos/, riscos-test/, tools/, docs/, ide/,
    dragon/, gamepane/, WinMojoGuide/, release/, bench/, utils/
                   new work original to this fork

The `riscos` branch also merges a Windows-x64 host port (WINMOJO) by the same
author, which is why host-side changes appear alongside the target work.

Per-file history is authoritative: see `git log` and `git diff f66d4d52..HEAD`.


